<title>PERU: Explosion at Peruvian fireworks factory kills six.</title>
<headline>Explosion at Peruvian fireworks factory kills six.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A fireworks factory in a Lima shantytown exploded on Wednesday and started a fire, killing six people and seriously injuring at least seven, Peruvian police said.</p>
<p>A spark ignited powder stored in the factory, they said.</p>
<p>&quot;The explosion destroyed the small factory and killed six people. All of the injured have been taken to local hospitals, but the fire has not yet been put out,&quot; police officer Hector Grados said.</p>
